         "step": 1,
         "text": "The derivative of e^x is e^x.",
         "mathjson": [
            "Exp",
            "x"
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The derivative of cos(x) is -sin(x), so -2cos(x) differentiates to 2sin(x).",
